<title>SOUTH AFRICA: King cautions it in talks.</title>
<headline>King cautions it in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>King Consolidated Holdings Ltd (formerly  King Food Holdings) said on Friday it was in talks which, if successful,  may have an effect on the price of its shares.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their sharedealings.</p>
<p>No further details were given in the brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
